-- Join 2 tables: right outer join
-- Join 2 tables: full outer join

-- Self join: inner join
-- Self join: cross join
-- Self join: natural join
-- Self join: semi join
-- Self join: anti join
-- Self join: left outer join
-- Self join: right outer join
-- Self join: full outer join

-- 3 way join

-- 4 way join

-- Join with no predicate: inner join
-- Join with no predicate: cross join
-- Join with no predicate: natural join
-- Join with no predicate: semi join
-- Join with no predicate: anti join
-- Join with no predicate: left outer join
-- Join with no predicate: right outer join
-- Join with no predicate: full outer join

-- ON clause
-- USING clause

-- Semi/anti joins return left columns only
-- Natural join only returns distinct column names
-- Inner/cross/outer joins return all columns

-- join syntax:
--    JOIN keyword
--    ','

